#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:4
msgid "Overview of Optimization Algorithms in Federated Learning"
msgstr "联邦学习中的优化算法概述"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:6
msgid ""
"The most important contribution of the initial work on federated learning "
"[:footcite:ct:`mcmahan2017fed_avg`] was the introduction of the Federated "
"Averaging algorithm (``FedAvg``). Mathematically, federated learning solves "
"the following problem of minimization of empirical risk function"
msgstr ""
"联邦学习开创性的文献 [:footcite:ct:`mcmahan2017fed_avg`] "
"中，最重要的贡献便是联邦平均算法（``FedAvg``）的提出。数学上，联邦学习求解如下极小化经验风险函数的问题"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:10
msgid ""
"\\begin{array}{cl}\n"
"\\underset{\\theta \\in \\mathbb{R}^d}{\\text{minimize}} & f(\\theta) = \\mathbb{E}_{k \\sim {\\mathcal{P}}} [f_k(\\theta)], \\\\\n"
"\\text{where} & f_k(\\theta) = \\mathbb{E}_{(x, y) \\sim \\mathcal{D}_k} [\\ell_k(\\theta; x, y)],\n"
"\\end{array}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:18
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\ell_k` is the loss function of client :math:`k`, "
":math:`\\mathcal{D}_k` is the data distribution of client :math:`k`, "
":math:`\\mathcal{P}` is the distribution of clients, and :math:`\\mathbb{E}`"
" is the expectation operator. If we simply let :math:`\\mathcal{P} = \\{1, "
"2, \\ldots, K\\}`, then the optimization problem can be simplified as"
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\ell_k` 是客户端 :math:`k` 的损失函数，:math:`\\mathcal{D}_k` 是客户端 "
":math:`k` 的数据分布，:math:`\\mathcal{P}` 是客户端的分布，:math:`\\mathbb{E}` 是期望算子。假设我们令"
" :math:`\\mathcal{P} = \\{1, 2, \\ldots, K\\}`，则上述优化问题可以简记为"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:23
msgid ""
"\\begin{array}{cl}\n"
"\\underset{\\theta \\in \\mathbb{R}^d}{\\text{minimize}} & f(\\theta) = \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K w_k f_k(\\theta).\n"
"\\end{array}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:30
msgid ""
"For further simplicity, we often take :math:`w_k = \\frac{1}{K}`. The "
"functions :math:`f_k` and :math:`f` are usually assumed to satisfy the "
"following conditions:"
msgstr ""
"通常，为了形式简便，我们令 :math:`w_k = \\frac{1}{K}`。对于 :math:`f` 以及 "
":math:`f_k`，我们一般假设它们满足如下几条最基本的假设："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:33
msgid ""
"(A1) :math:`f_k` and :math:`f` are :math:`L`-smooth (:math:`L > 0`), i.e. "
"they have :math:`L`-Lipschitz continuous gradients:"
msgstr ""
"(A1) :math:`f` 以及 :math:`f_k` 都是 :math:`L`-光滑的（:math:`L > 0`），亦即它们有 "
"Lipschitz-连续的梯度："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:35
msgid ""
"\\begin{array}{c}\n"
"\\lVert \\nabla f (\\theta) - f (\\theta') \\rVert \\leqslant L \\lVert \\theta - \\theta' \\rVert, \\\\\n"
"\\lVert \\nabla f_k (\\theta) - f_k (\\theta') \\rVert \\leqslant L \\lVert \\theta - \\theta' \\rVert,\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
"\\quad \\forall \\theta, \\theta' \\in \\mathbb{R}^d, k = 1, \\ldots, K."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:44
msgid "(A2) The range of :math:`f`"
msgstr "(A2) :math:`f` 的值域"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:46
msgid ""
"\\text{dom}(f) := \\{ \\theta \\in \\mathbb{R}^d ~|~ f(\\theta) < + \\infty \\}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:49
msgid ""
"is nonempty and lower bounded, i.e. there exists a constant :math:`c \\in "
"\\mathbb{R}` such that"
msgstr "非空，且下有界 (Lower Bounded)：存在常数 :math:`c \\in \\mathbb{R}`，使得"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:51
msgid "f(\\theta) \\geqslant c > -\\infty, ~ \\forall \\theta \\in \\mathbb{R}^d,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:56
msgid "or equivalently,"
msgstr "或等价地"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:58
msgid "f^* := \\inf\\limits_{\\theta \\in \\mathbb{R}^d} f(\\theta) > - \\infty."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:63
msgid ""
"In many cases, in order to facilitate the analysis of convergence, we will "
"also make some assumptions about the gradient of the objective function:"
msgstr "很多时候，为了方便收敛性的分析，我们还会对目标函数的梯度进行一些假设："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:66
msgid "(A3) Bounded gradient: there exists a constant :math:`G > 0` such that"
msgstr "(A3) 梯度有界性 (Bounded Gradient)：存在常数 :math:`G > 0`，使得"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:68
msgid ""
"\\lVert \\nabla f_k (\\theta) \\rVert^2 \\leqslant G^2, ~ \\forall \\theta "
"\\in \\mathbb{R}^d, ~ k = 1, \\ldots K."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:73
msgid "And the following assumptions on data distributions:"
msgstr "数据分布的特征（是否独立同分布，以及非独立同分布的程度）是联邦学习绕不开的问题，对此有如下假设："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:75
msgid ""
"(A4-1) Data distribution is I.I.D. (identically and independently "
"distributed) across clients, i.e."
msgstr "(A4-1) 数据独立同分布 (I.I.D.)："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:77
msgid ""
"\\nabla f(\\theta) = \\mathbb{E} [f_k(\\theta)] = \\mathbb{E}_{(x, y) \\sim "
"\\mathcal{D}_k}[\\nabla \\ell_k(\\theta; x, y)], ~ \\forall \\theta \\in "
"\\mathbb{R}^d, ~ k = 1, \\ldots K,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:82
msgid ""
"or equivalently, for any :math:`\\varepsilon > 0`, there exists a constant "
":math:`B \\geqslant 0` such that"
msgstr "或者，对任意 :math:`\\varepsilon > 0`，存在常数 :math:`B \\geqslant 0`，满足"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:84
msgid ""
"\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\lVert \\nabla f_k(\\theta) \\rVert^2 = \\lVert f(\\theta) \\rVert^2,\n"
"~ \\forall \\theta \\in \\left\\{ \\theta \\in \\mathbb{R}^d ~ \\middle| ~ \\lVert f(\\theta) \\rVert^2 > \\varepsilon \\right\\}."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:92
msgid ""
"(A4-2) Data distribution is non-I.I.D across clients, in which case we need "
"a quantity to measure the degree of this statistical heterogeneity. This "
"quantity can be defined in a number of ways "
"[:footcite:ct:`karimireddy2020scaffold, zhang2020fedpd, li2019convergence, "
"sahu2018fedprox`]. For example, in [:footcite:ct:`karimireddy2020scaffold`] "
"and [:footcite:ct:`zhang2020fedpd`], the so-called bounded gradient "
"dissimilarity (BGD), denoted as :math:`(G; B)`-BGD, is used as this "
"quantity. More specifically, there exists constants :math:`G > 0` and "
":math:`B \\geqslant 0` such that"
msgstr ""
"(A4-2) 数据非独立同分布 (Non-I.I.D.)，这时候我们需要有一个量，用来度量这种统计上的异质性的程度。这个量可以有多种定义方式 "
"[:footcite:ct:`karimireddy2020scaffold, zhang2020fedpd, li2019convergence, "
"sahu2018fedprox`]，这里采用 [:footcite:ct:`karimireddy2020scaffold`] 与 "
"[:footcite:ct:`zhang2020fedpd`] 中定义的梯度差异有界性 (Bounded Gradient Dissimilarity,"
" BGD)，记作 :math:`(G; B)`-BGD。具体来说，存在常数 :math:`G > 0` 以及 :math:`B \\geqslant "
"0`，满足"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:99
msgid ""
"\\dfrac{1}{K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\lVert \\nabla f_k(\\theta) \\rVert^2 "
"\\leqslant G^2 + B^2 \\lVert \\nabla f(\\theta) \\rVert^2, ~ \\forall "
"\\theta \\in \\mathbb{R}^d."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:104
msgid ""
"It should be noted that letting :math:`B = 0`, the bounded gradient "
"dissimilarity condition (A4-2) degenrates to the bounded gradient condition "
"(A3)."
msgstr "需要注意的是，如果令 :math:`B = 0`，那么梯度差异有界性条件（A4-2）就退化为梯度有界性条件（A3）。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:107
msgid ""
"Sometimes, in the proof of algorithm convergence, one needs to make "
"assumptions on the convexity of the objective function :math:`f`, which can "
"be defined as follows:"
msgstr "很多时候，在证明算法收敛性的时候，我们需要对目标函数 :math:`f` 进行一些凸性方面的假设，其定义如下："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:110
msgid "(A5-1) convexity:"
msgstr "(A5-1) 凸性："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:112
msgid ""
"f(a \\theta + (1 - a) \\theta') \\leqslant a f(\\theta) + (1 - a) f(\\theta'),\n"
"~ \\forall \\theta, \\theta' \\in \\mathcal{C}, ~ \\alpha \\in [0, 1]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:118
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\mathcal{C}` is a convex set on which :math:`f` is defined."
msgstr "其中 :math:`\\mathcal{C}` 是一个凸集，:math:`f` 定义在其上。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:120
msgid ""
"(A5-2) Strong convexity: there exists a constant :math:`\\mu > 0` such that "
":math:`f - \\frac{\\mu}{2} \\lVert \\theta \\rVert^2` is convex. In this "
"case, we say that :math:`f` is :math:`\\mu`-strongly convex."
msgstr ""
"(A5-2) 强凸性：:math:`\\mu > 0`，若 :math:`f - \\frac{\\mu}{2} \\lVert \\theta "
"\\rVert^2` 是凸函数，则称 :math:`f` 是 :math:`\\mu`-强凸函数。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:123
msgid ""
"Due to the natural layered and decoupled structure of the federal learning "
"problem, it is more natural to consider the following constrained "
"optimization problem:"
msgstr "由于联邦学习天然的分层以及可解耦的结构，更方便以及自然的做法，是将问题写成如下约束优化问题的格式："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:126
msgid ""
"\\begin{array}{cl}\n"
"\\text{minimize} & \\frac{1}{K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K f_k(\\theta_k), \\\\\n"
"\\text{subject to} & \\theta_k = \\theta, ~ k = 1, \\ldots, K.\n"
"\\end{array}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:134
msgid ""
"It is easy to find the equivalence between the constrained optimization "
"problem :eq:`fl-basic-constraint` and the unconstrained optimization problem"
" :eq:`fl-basic`. The constrained formulation :eq:`fl-basic-constraint` is "
"called the **consensus problem** in the literature of distributed "
"optimization [:footcite:ct:`boyd2011distributed`]. The superiority of the "
"constrained formulation :eq:`fl-basic-constraint` is that the objective "
"function becomes block-separable, which is more suitable for the design of "
"parallel and distributed algorithms."
msgstr ""
"我们很容易看出约束优化问题 :eq:`fl-basic-constraint` 与无约束优化问题 :eq:`fl-basic` 两种格式的等价性。格式 "
":eq:`fl-basic-constraint` 在分布式优化中被称作共识优化问题 (Consensus Problem) "
"[:footcite:ct:`boyd2011distributed`]。这种格式的好处是，目标函数变成了分块可分离的 (Block "
"Separable)，这对设计可并行化的算法是巨大的便利。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:140
msgid "Federated Averaging Algorithm"
msgstr "联邦平均算法"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:142
msgid ""
"The core idea of the ``FedAvg`` algorithm is to make full use of the local "
"computation resources of each client so that each client can perform "
"multiple local iterations before uploading the local model to the server. It"
" alleviates the problem of straggler clients and reduces the communication "
"overhead, hence accelerating the convergence of the algorithm. This may well"
" be thought of as a simple form of **skipping** algorithm, which were "
"further developed in [:footcite:ct:`zhang2020fedpd, proxskip, proxskip-vr`]."
" Pseudocode for ``FedAvg`` is shown as follows:"
msgstr ""
"联邦平均算法的核心思想，是充分利用子节点的计算能力，在以学习率 :math:`\\eta` 执行完一定轮数的随机梯度下降 (Stochastic "
"Gradient Descent, SGD) 之后，由中心节点收集各子节点发送过来的模型参数，进行平均 "
"(Averaging)，之后再将平均之后的模型参数广播 (Broadcast) 给子节点进行下一轮迭代。这样规避了每一轮 SGD "
"都进行通信带来的巨大的通信开销，在加速模型训练的同时，数值上在某些情况下还有更好的收敛性。这实际上是一种比较朴素与简单的“跳步”的思想，这种思想在随后的研究"
" [:footcite:ct:`zhang2020fedpd, proxskip, proxskip-vr`] "
"中也得到了进一步的发展。``FedAvg`` 的伪代码如下："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:153
msgid ""
"``FedAvg`` achieved some good numerical results (see Section 3 of "
"[:footcite:ct:`mcmahan2017fed_avg`]), but its convergence, espcially under "
"non-I.I.D. data distributions, is not properly analyzed (see "
"[:footcite:ct:`khaled2019_first, Khaled2020_tighter`]). There are several "
"works that deal with this issue (such as "
"[:footcite:ct:`zhou_2018_convergence, li2019convergence`]) with extra "
"assumptions such as the convexity of the objective function :math:`f`, etc."
msgstr ""
"联邦平均算法 ``FedAvg`` 在数值上取得了一些不错的实验结果（见 [:footcite:ct:`mcmahan2017fed_avg`] 第 3"
" 节），但是其收敛性，特别是在数据非独立同分布的情况下，并未得到很好的分析（见 [:footcite:ct:`khaled2019_first, "
"Khaled2020_tighter`]）。后续的文献（如 [:footcite:ct:`zhou_2018_convergence, "
"li2019convergence`]）处理了这一问题，但添加了诸如 :math:`f` 强凸等额外假设。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:160
msgid "``FedAvg`` from the Perspective of Optimization"
msgstr "最优化理论视角下的联邦平均算法"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:162
msgid ""
"In this section, we will analyze the ``FedAvg`` algorithm from the "
"perspective of optimization theory. In fact, the optimization problem "
":eq:`fl-basic` that ``FedAvg`` solves can be equivalently reformulated as "
"the following constrained optimization problem:"
msgstr ""
"我们从最优化理论的角度对联邦平均算法 ``FedAvg`` 进行分析。事实上，``FedAvg`` 所处理的优化问题 :eq:`fl-basic` "
"可以等价地改写为如下的约束优化问题："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:166
msgid ""
"\\newcommand{\\col}{\\operatorname{col}}\n"
"\n"
"\\begin{array}{cl}\n"
"\\text{minimize} & F(\\Theta) := \\frac{1}{K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K f_k(\\theta_k), \\\\\n"
"\\text{subject to} & \\Theta \\in \\mathcal{E},\n"
"\\end{array}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:176
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\Theta = \\col(\\theta_1, \\cdots, \\theta_K) := "
"\\begin{pmatrix} \\theta_1 \\\\ \\vdots \\\\ \\theta_K \\end{pmatrix}, "
"\\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K \\in \\mathbb{R}^d` and :math:`\\mathcal{E} = "
"\\left\\{ \\Theta ~ \\middle| ~ \\theta_1 = \\cdots = \\theta_K \\right\\}` "
"is a convex set in :math:`\\mathbb{R}^{Kd}`. Projected gradient descent "
"(PGD) is an effective method for solving the constrained optimization "
"problem :eq:`fedavg-constraint`, which has the following update rule:"
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\Theta = \\col(\\theta_1, \\cdots, \\theta_K) := \\begin{pmatrix}"
" \\theta_1 \\\\ \\vdots \\\\ \\theta_K \\end{pmatrix}, \\theta_1, \\ldots, "
"\\theta_K \\in \\mathbb{R}^d`，:math:`\\mathcal{E} = \\left\\{ \\Theta ~ "
"\\middle| ~ \\theta_1 = \\cdots = \\theta_K \\right\\}` 是 "
":math:`\\mathbb{R}^{Kd}` 中一个凸集。我们知道，投影梯度下降法 (Projected Gradient Descent, "
"PGD) 是求解问题 :eq:`fedavg-constraint` 的一个有效算法，其迭代格式为："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:181
msgid ""
"\\Theta^{(t+1)} = \\Pi_{\\mathcal{E}} \\left( \\Theta^{(t)} - \\eta \\nabla "
"F(\\Theta^{(t)}) \\right),"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:186
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\Pi_{\\mathcal{E}}` is the projection operator onto the set "
":math:`\\mathcal{E}`. It is easy to show that the projection operator onto "
"the set :math:`\\mathcal{E}` is indeed the average operator, i.e.,"
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\Pi_{\\mathcal{E}}` 是到集合 :math:`\\mathcal{E}` 的投影算子。容易看出，到集合 "
":math:`\\mathcal{E} = \\left\\{ \\Theta ~ \\middle| ~ \\theta_1 = \\cdots = "
"\\theta_K \\right\\}` 的投影映射就是“求平均”映射："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:189
msgid ""
"\\Pi_{\\mathcal{E}}: \\mathbb{R}^{Kd} \\to \\mathcal{E}: ( \\theta_1, "
"\\ldots, \\theta_K) \\mapsto \\left(\\frac{1}{K}\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K "
"\\theta_K, \\ldots, \\frac{1}{K}\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\theta_K \\right)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:194
msgid ""
"We have shown that mathematically the ``FedAvg`` algorithm is indeed a kind "
"of stochastic projected gradient descent (SPGD) algorithm, where the clients"
" perform local stochastic gradient descent (SGD) updates and the server "
"performs the projection step :eq:`fedavg-projection`."
msgstr ""
"也就是说，联邦平均算法在数学上，实质上是一种随机投影梯度法：子节点执行的是梯度步（具体来说是用的随机梯度下降），中心节点执行的是投影步 "
":eq:`fedavg-projection`。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:199
msgid "A Direct Improvement of ``FedAvg``"
msgstr "联邦平均算法的改进"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:201
msgid ""
"Since ``FedAvg`` is based on stochastic gradient descent (SGD), it is "
"natural to consider applying acceleration techniques [:footcite:ct:`adagrad,"
" adam, Zaheer_2018_yogi, adamw_amsgrad`] to improve the algorithm "
"performance. Computation on clients and on the server are relatively "
"decoupled, so it does not require large modifications to the whole algorithm"
" framework. Indeed, the authors of the ``FedAvg`` paper put this idea into "
"practice and proposed a federated learning framework called ``FedOpt`` "
"[:footcite:ct:`reddi2020fed_opt`] which has stronger adaptability. The "
"pseudocode for ``FedOpt`` is shown as follows:"
msgstr ""
"因为联邦平均算法是以随机梯度下降法为基础的，那么一个自然的想法就是将随机梯度下降法的一些加速的技巧 [:footcite:ct:`adagrad, "
"adam, Zaheer_2018_yogi, adamw_amsgrad`] "
"引入联邦学习整个算法体系内。由于联邦学习子节点与中心节点的计算相对独立、没有耦合，所以这种做法并不需要对联邦学习整个算法框架做大改动，是一种可行的方法。事实上，联邦平均算法的作者在随后发表的文章"
" [:footcite:ct:`reddi2020fed_opt`] 中实践了这一想法，提出了一个泛用性更强的自适应联邦学习算法框架 "
"``FedOpt``，其伪代码如下："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:212
msgid ""
"In the above pseudocode, :math:`\\operatorname{aggregate} \\left( \\left\\{ "
"\\Delta_{k}^{(t)} \\right\\}_{k \\in \\mathcal{S}^{(t)}} \\right)` refers to"
" some method that aggregates the local inertia updates "
":math:`\\Delta_{k}^{(t)}` from the selected clients "
":math:`\\mathcal{S}^{(t)}` into a global inertia update "
":math:`\\Delta^{(t)}`. This method, for example, can be simply averaging"
msgstr ""
"这里的 :math:`\\operatorname{aggregate} \\left( \\left\\{ \\Delta_{k}^{(t)} "
"\\right\\}_{k \\in \\mathcal{S}^{(t)}} \\right)` 指的是将来自子节点的惯性项 "
":math:`\\Delta_{k}^{(t)}` 聚合为全局惯性量的方法，例如可以采用简单的均值"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:216
msgid ""
"\\Delta^{(t)} \\gets \\frac{1}{\\lvert \\mathcal{S}^{(t)} \\rvert} "
"\\sum\\limits_{k \\in \\mathcal{S}^{(t)}} \\Delta_{k}^{(t)},"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:221
msgid "or linear combination with inertia of the previous iteration"
msgstr "或者与上一步惯性量的线性组合"

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:223
msgid ""
"\\Delta^{(t)} \\gets \\beta_1 \\Delta^{(t-1)} + \\left( (1 - \\beta_1) / "
"\\lvert \\mathcal{S}^{(t)} \\rvert \\right) \\sum_{k \\in "
"\\mathcal{S}^{(t)}} \\Delta_{k}^{(t)}."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:228
msgid ""
"As one has already noticed, compared to ``FedAvg``, ``FedOpt`` introduces "
"some momentum terms on the server node (in **ServerOpt**) to accelerate the "
"convergence. In [:footcite:ct:`reddi2020fed_opt`], the authors listed "
"several options for **ServerOpt**:"
msgstr ""
"我们注意到，相比于联邦平均算法 ``FedAvg``，自适应联邦学习算法 ``FedOpt`` 在中心节点引入了带动量 (Momentum) 的项，即 "
"**ServerOpt**，用于加速。我们列举一些 **ServerOpt** 可供选择的方法 "
"[:footcite:ct:`reddi2020fed_opt`]："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:231
msgid "``FedAdagrad``:"
msgstr "``FedAdagrad``："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:233
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"v^{(t)} & \\gets v^{(t-1)} + ( \\Delta^{(t)} )^2 \\\\\n"
"\\theta^{(t+1)} & \\gets \\theta^{(t)} + \\eta_g \\Delta^{(t)} / (\\sqrt{v^{(t)}}+\\tau)\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:241
msgid "``FedYogi``:"
msgstr "``FedYogi``："

#: ../../source/algorithms/overview.rst:243
msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"v^{(t)} & \\gets v^{(t-1)} - (1 - \\beta_2) ( \\Delta^{(t)} )^2 \\operatorname{sign}(v^{(t-1)} - ( \\Delta^{(t)} )^2) \\\\\n"
"\\theta^{(t+1)} & \\gets \\theta^{(t)} + \\eta_g \\Delta^{(t)} / (\\sqrt{v^{(t)}}+\\tau)\n"
"\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""

